--                 “stackoverflow.com/questions/”.
--               • Use REGEXP_EXTRACT to pull the numeric question-id.
--               • Group by that id and count how many times each question was
--                 mentioned.
--               • Order by the mention count (descending) and show the top 20
--                 to validate extraction logic before diving into tag analysis.
